  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Walking distance to the beach<br>- Private pool **Pool heating is available for this property from October 1 through May 1 for $45 per day**<br>- Conveniently located in the heart of Grayton Beach<br>- Views of the Gulf and Western Lake<br>- Double amount of washer, dryer, dishwasher, and refrigerators <br>- 6 Passenger Low-Speed Vehicle <br>- Flat-screen TVs in every bedroom<br>- Balconies in every bedroom<br>- 6 adult bikes<br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - All linens, including comforter covers, laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: There's something for everyone to enjoy at \"Shades of Summer!\" Welcome to the 6-bedroom, 6.5-bathroom home that sleeps 16 guests in the heart of Grayton Beach. All of the bedrooms are \"suite\" - there are en-suite bathrooms, flat-screen TVs and balconies in every room. It's located just a few homes back from award-winning beaches and steps from a rare coastal dune lake and protected state parkland. There are 2 washer and dryers, 2 dishwashers and 2 refrigerators, making it perfect for large groups. This classic beach home has fresh exterior paint, includes 6 complimentary adult bikes and a private pool with a sunning deck. <br><br>On the first floor are 2 bedrooms adjacent to the entry room. The first is a spacious bunk room that includes 4 sets of bunks built into the wall- 2 full-size and 2 twins. It doubles as a game room with a flat-screen TV, en-suite bathroom, and porch. The other bedroom has two king beds, en-suite bathroom with a shower only, and access to the porch.<br><br>The main level hosts the kitchen and living room that open up to a balcony overlooking Garfield Street. The recently updated, gourmet kitchen includes premium Thermador appliances, fully equipped utensils, designer cabinetry, and casual eating for 8 at the bar. 2 dining tables have seating for 15 to enjoy a meal together. A king bedroom is down the hall with a private bathroom and balcony. <br><br>Upstairs, there are 3 more bedrooms. All are primary suites contain king beds, private balconies, and en suite bathrooms. A large top-level deck is perfect for sunning and catching a glimpse of the breathtaking sunset over the Gulf. World-class dining and shopping are just a short walk away along the path to the beach. This home is very popular for families, corporate retreats, and wedding parties!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: (SLEEPS 16):<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>-Guest Bedroom: Two King Beds, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>-Guest Bedroom: Two Queen Bunks and Two Twin Bunks, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>-Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/ Tub Combo<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Spend Spring Break with Us! Gulf Views! Steps from the Beach! Private Pool!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
